{
  "pros": [
    "Securely stores and manages passwords and OTP codes",
    "Offers flexible item creation and organization for various credential types",
    "Affordable, open-source solution for a small team"
  ],
  "cons": [
    "Occasional inconsistencies with browser extension autofill or syncing",
    "Initial setup might have a slight learning curve for some features",
    "Some administrative tasks might be less intuitive or require web access"
  ],
  "changed": [
    "Pro 2: The original 'Facilitates easy and secure sharing' was too broad and partially contradicted by notes indicating friction in setting up sharing and organization management. The new pro 'Offers flexible item creation and organization for various credential types' is supported by notes like 'The Add button offers Login, Card, Identity, Note, SSH key and Folder in one dropdown' and 'A login or secure note saves with only the Item name filled (username and password optional)' and 'The vault and the org collections view both have a filter panel by type (Login, Card, Identity, Secure note, SSH key), plus Collections, Trash and a search box', which highlight the flexibility and ease of creating and finding different item types."
  ]
}
